          "createdAt": "2026-09-28T07:57:47Z",
          "description": "Small Yet Powerful: By swapping out silicon for GaN we've been able to fit 30W of power into a charger that's just 1.12 inches thick, and 70% smaller than an original 30W charger. Nano Now Charges Everything: Upgraded with a 30W output so now you can charge your earbuds, phone, tablet, and even your MacBook Air with a tiny charger. High-Speed Charging: Deliver full-speed 30W charging for iPhone 13 Pro and Pro Max, or power up your iPad Air (5th Generation) to 50% in just 45 minutes. Also supports Samsung Super Fast Charging (25W). Upgraded Protection with ActiveShield 2.0: Anker's proprietary technology safeguards your devices by intelligently monitoring temperature over 3 million times per day\u2014that's twice as often as ActiveShield 1.0. What You Get: Anker 511 Charger (Nano 3, 30W), User Manual, our worry-free 24-month warranty, and friendly customer service (cable not included).",
          "descriptionHtml": "<p>\u00a0</p>\n<div data-page-id=\"doxcnaapP8ycXXjQAWdI46K7Du8\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnOE8sgssu06Sa8idFVjoOka\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Small Yet Powerful:</strong> By swapping out silicon for GaN we've been able to fit 30W of power into a charger that's just 1.12 inches thick, and 70% smaller than an original 30W charger.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnIIqC6Qw6y0AWMLrRzaapGb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn0QoguOCC4CgswPtDaGhshf\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Nano Now Charges Everything:</strong> Upgraded with a 30W output so now you can charge your earbuds, phone, tablet, and even your MacBook Air with a tiny charger.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnQQ2aGSOSoCMs40EUjy1BLc\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn4gMMKEkUoiqmieon3GGJVh\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>High-Speed Charging:</strong> Deliver full-speed 30W charging for iPhone 13 Pro and Pro Max, or power up your iPad Air (5th Generation) to 50% in just 45 minutes. Also supports Samsung Super Fast Charging (25W).</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnukeqmeQqWQEyOuFOFDCaob\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnGeow6Q6UOSYw0KwTTSjrKb\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>Upgraded Protection with ActiveShield 2.0: </strong>Anker's proprietary technology safeguards your devices by intelligently monitoring temperature over 3 million times per day\u2014that's twice as often as ActiveShield 1.0.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcn0mWwUOW4kgqiYPMNw1nsBg\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"><br data-mce-fragment=\"1\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-doxcnmcm24syc2QM80WbjvoJOrd\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\">\n<strong>What You Get:</strong> Anker <strong data-mce-fragment=\"1\">511</strong> Charger (Nano 3, 30W), User Manual, our worry-free 24-month warranty, and friendly customer service (cable not included).</div>\n</div>\n<p><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;isCut&quot;:false,&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;doxcnaapP8ycXXjQAWdI46K7Du8&quot;,&quot;parentId&quot;:&quot;doxcnaapP8ycXXjQAWdI46K7Du8&quot;,&quot;blockIds&quot;:[19,20,21,22,23,24,25,26,27],&quot;recordIds&quot;:[&quot;doxcnOE8sgssu06Sa8idFVjoOka&quot;,&quot;doxcnIIqC6Qw6y0AWMLrRzaapGb&quot;,&quot;doxcn0QoguOCC4CgswPtDaGhshf&quot;,&quot;doxcnQQ2aGSOSoCMs40EUjy1BLc&quot;,&quot;doxcn4gMMKEkUoiqmieon3GGJVh&quot;,&quot;doxcnukeqmeQqWQEyOuFOFDCaob&quot;,&quot;doxcnGeow6Q6UOSYw0KwTTSjrKb&quot;,&quot;doxcn0mWwUOW4kgqiYPMNw1nsBg&quot;,&quot;doxcnmcm24syc2QM80WbjvoJOrd&quot;],&quot;recordMap&quot;:{&quot;doxcnOE8sgssu06Sa8idFVjoOka&quot;:{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;doxcnOE8sgssu06Sa8idFVjoOka&quot;,&quot;snapshot&quot;:{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;parent_id&quot;:&quot;doxcnaapP8ycXXjQAWdI46K7Du8&quot;,&quot;comments&quot;:[&quot;7130128691513819164&quot;],&quot;locked&quot;:false,&quot;hidden&quot;:false,&quot;author&quot;:&quot;6950835076225630212&quot;,&quot;children&quot;:[],&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;initialAttributedTexts&quot;:{&quot;text&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;Small Yet Powerful: By swapping out silicon for Gallium Nitride (GaN) we've been able to fit 30W of power into a charger that's just 1.12 inches thick, and 70% smaller than an original 30W charger.&quot;},&quot;attribs&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:&quot;*0*1+w*2*0*1+3*0*1+4i&quot;}},&quot;apool&quot;:{&quot;numToAttrib&quot;:{&quot;0&quot;:[&quot;author&quot;,&quot;6911994833812930564&quot;],&quot;1&quot;:[&quot;comment-id-7130128691513819164&quot;,&quot;true&quot;],&quot;2&quot;:[&quot;abbreviation-data&quot;,&quot;{\\&quot;id\\&quot;:\\&quot;b1e031b4-c9c9-4322-a753-4a1f4d4fe7ff\\&quot;,\\&quot;abbr_ids\\&quot;