          "description": "Power 6 Devices at Once: Includes dual USB-C ports and a USB-A on the power bank, plus three high-output ports on the base for full-speed multi-device charging. 300W Total Output Power: Delivers 300W max output exclusively from the power bank, shared across two USB-C ports and one USB-A port. Designed to power multiple high-performance devices simultaneously, including laptops and other demanding electronics. High-Speed Recharging: Recharge the power bank using the charging base alone at 150W input, reaching 50% in about 21 minutes. For even faster recharging, connect the charging base together with a USB-C input to achieve up to 250W total input, charging from 0 to 50% in as little as 13 minutes. Charge Smarter with App: Use the app to manage power flow, check live stats, and customize how your display looks. What You Get: Anker Prime Power Bank (26K, 300W), Anker Prime Charging Base (150W, 3 Ports), 3.3 ft USB-C to USB-C charging cable (240W), power cord for charging base, travel pouch, welcome guide, 24-month warranty, and our friendly customer service.",
          "descriptionHtml": "<div data-page-id=\"Eib0dKu9ko6WZRxuq8NloqxUgkh\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P1lUdOAzooPCgnx1Ah8lDfBEgOf\">\n<strong>Power 6 Devices at Once: </strong>Includes dual USB-C ports and a USB-A on the power bank, plus three high-output ports on the base for full-speed multi-device charging.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FBBUdLmanoGOz8xKFC8lPij7gf8\">\n<span><strong>300W Total Output Power: </strong></span><span>Delivers 300W max output exclusively from the power bank, shared across two </span><span>USB-C</span><span> ports and one USB-A port. Designed to power multiple high-performance devices simultaneously, including laptops and other demanding electronics.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-A5TPdQ5Wuo5Gilxvte2l2nVmgae\">\n<span><strong>High-Speed Recharging: </strong></span><span>Recharge the power bank using the charging base alone at 150W input, reaching 50% in about 21 minutes. For even faster recharging, connect the charging base together with a </span><span>USB-C</span><span> input to achieve up to 250W total input, charging from 0 to 50% in as little as 13 minutes.</span>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SN7TdWAdlo7yuMxMIAVlpK8pgwl\">\n<strong>Charge Smarter with </strong><strong>App</strong><strong>: </strong>Use the app to manage power flow, check live stats, and customize how your display looks.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DGjYdcnkCoKTrCxFAl4l2VOmgab\">\n<strong>What You Get: </strong><span>Anker Prime Power </span><span>Bank</span><span> (26K, 300W), Anker Prime Charging Base (150W, 3 </span><span>Ports), 3.3 ft </span><span>USB-C</span><span> to USB-C charging cable (240W)</span><span>, power cord for charging base, travel pouch</span><span>, welcome guide, 24-month warranty, </span><span>and our friendly customer service.</span>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
